EW API FORMATTED COMMENT
TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY arc2trigII

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK details.html

LINK_NAME Sample Config File
LINK arc2trigII.d.txt

LINK_NAME Programmer Notes
LINK programmer_notes.txt

DESCRIPTION <b>arc2trigII</b> is an enhanced version of <b>arc2trig</b>.
<br><br> 
<b>arc2trig</b> creates an Earthworm "trigger message" detailing snippets 
of waveform data from various channels that should be saved.  
The list of snippets is generated based upon the contents of 
a Hypoinverse Archive(arc) message.  
<br><br> 
<b>arc2trigII</b> further enhances the functionality of <b>arc2trig</b> by saving
snippets of interest which were not listed in the arc message. 
<br><br>
Initial version by Alex 02/21/01


